WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.880
This battle royal was a test to select duel warriors?

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.240
What are you talking about?

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:07.920
Answer me, Reiji Akaba!

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:13.450
Did you know from the start that Fusion 
Dimension guys would be here, too?

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.890
Yes, I knew.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:20.170
That's why, starting with the third 
battle of the Junior Youth Class,

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:23.370
I changed the format from a tournament 
to a battle royal in town.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:27.570
I was hoping you could use your 
power to vanquish the enemy.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.300
Our power?

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.100
Why us, the Junior Youth, instead of 
the Pros or Youth Classes?

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.920
The Youth Class did fight...

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.120
They were all beaten, except for one.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.380
All beaten?

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:45.400
That's why I was sent in.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.990
Just as I had hoped,

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.760
you succeeded in repelling Academia.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:54.100
You have truly shown power worthy of

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:58.470
the Academia-fighting duel warriors, the Lancers.

00:00:58.470 --> 00:00:59.840
Give me a break!

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.580
Who cares about your Lancers?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.310
Because of you, Michio,

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:07.510
Teppei, and the others were turned into cards!

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.660
And Yuzu was...

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:13.240
Darling...

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:24.290
Implementing mass into Solid Vision 
has created Action Duels.

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:29.040
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.120
the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:10.940
Lancers 
Chosen Warriors

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.120
Because of you, everyone was...

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:15.670
Yuzu was...

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.040
It isn't Reiji's fault.

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:23.520
It was my fault that Academia defeated Yuzu.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:26.320
What do you mean, "your fault"?

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:28.660
Who are you, anyway?

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:32.040
I am Serena, a duelist from Academia.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:32.990
What?

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:36.460
Academia? Doesn't that mean you're our enemy?

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:39.630
There she goes, admitting to it right off...

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:42.720
I thought I could take her back to Academia,

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:44.700
but I guess that isn't happening now.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.670
What's an enemy doing here?

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.950
And dressed as Yuzu Hiiragi...

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:53.070
Are you a spy? Are you looking for something 
by pretending to be Yuzu?

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:54.950
That's it! That must be it!

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.180
Hey! Get out of my way!

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:00.360
Are you protecting an enemy?!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:03.180
I have an agreement with my client.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:05.920
And exactly who is your client?

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.330
Serena is not a spy.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.780
She is on the run from Academia.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:15.120
That's right. The Obelisk Force is after me.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.480
Yuzu was probably mistaken for me.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.750
Mistaken for you?

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.410
Why did you trade clothes?

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:23.110
Because...

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:26.140
She wanted me to speak to Kurosaki.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.320
What?

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:31.530
Yuzu told me to meet Kurosaki

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:34.720
and directly ask what happened 
in the Xyz Dimension.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:39.860
To achieve that, she said she'd be my decoy, 
and draw the Obelisk Force's pursuit.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:41.820
No way...

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.620
I see. So that's what happened...

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.540
You fought and survived.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.740
What we need now is that strength.

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:00.120
Rather than focusing on what you've lost,

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:03.720
you should take pride in winning 
the duel against a powerful foe.

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:06.940
Shut up! Pride?!

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:10.620
If you hadn't made us fight...

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.280
Bring Yuzu...

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.460
Bring everyone back!

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.180
If you are a duelist,

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:22.070
channel your anger not into fists, but a duel!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.680
I'll do it!

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.000
In place of Yuzu and the others, 
who were turned into cards,

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.770
I'll bring you to your knees!

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.430
Very well.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:36.600
If I lose, I promise to perform 
penance until you're satisfied.

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:49.380
What is Reiji doing there?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:50.830
You don't seem aware of our mission yet.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:55.790
Why did I decide to bring the Lancers together?

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.770
It was to save our home

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:01.010
from the same tragedy that befell the Xyz Dimension.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.240
Action Field, on!

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.980
I activate Neo Heartland City!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.640
Heartland City... The Xyz Dimension's...

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:21.640
That's right.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:25.100
My... Our...

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.670
Homeland!

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:34.370
Kurosaki, do as Yuzu Hiiragi would 
have wished, and tell us...

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:37.340
What happened in Heartland City?

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:47.330
Too mortified to speak?

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:49.250
Then, allow me to speak for you.

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:55.310
The Fusion Dimension's Academia, which 
attacked you during the battle royal—

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.230
Stop it!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.190
Don't do this.

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:01.130
Darling!

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:01.700
Yuya!

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:03.940
Before they came here...

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:04.910
Stop it.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.910
They were in the Xyz Dimension...

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:07.900
Stop it!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.010
I won't let you say any more!

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:13.820
I'll crush you into the ground, and make 
you regret your actions!

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:15.500
Duel!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:22.400
I set the Pendulum Scale with 
Scale 4 Performapal Trump Witch

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.320
and Scale 8 Xiangsheng Magician!

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:34.970
Now, I can summon monsters between 
Levels 5 and 7 simultaneously!

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:37.940
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:40.390
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:42.620
Pendulum Summon!

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:45.590
Come out, my monsters!

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:49.160
Stargazer Magician!

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:53.050
And Performapal Splashmammoth!

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:55.850
He went right to Pendulum Summoning.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:57.760
Yuya's really taking this seriously...

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:00.230
I now end my turn!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.570
What did Yuzu Hiiragi tell you?

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:06.200
What would one from Academia want to know?

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.840
My turn. Draw!

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:15.930
The effect of D/D Swirl Slime in my hand

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:20.490
allows it to be fused with D/D Berfomet in my hand.

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:24.300
Swirl of secrets that changes forms at will,

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:29.950
engulf the deformed god, become one, 
and give birth to the new king!

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.660
Fusion Summon.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:36.120
Be reborn, D/D/D Flame King Genghis!

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:38.680
Flame King Genghis,

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:42.330
the Fusion Monster Reiji used 
the last time they fought.

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:46.570
My darling fought Reiji Akaba before?

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.360
Yes, at You Show School.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.300
Who won then?

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.930
We were interrupted before they finished.

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.240
But if they'd continued...

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:02.020
I also summon Tuner Monster 
D/D Nighthowl from my hand!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.580
A Tuner Monster?

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:11.960
Yes, Fusion Summoning isn't the only 
technique that Reiji employs!

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:14.930
When I succeed in summoning this card,

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:18.350
I can Special Summon one 
D/D Monster in my graveyard,

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:21.640
with its attack points changed to 0.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:26.090
Be reborn, D/D Berfomet!

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:34.520
Level 3 D/D Nighthowl tunes Level 4 D/D Berfomet!

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:41.560
The roar that cuts through the darkness,

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:46.270
gain the speed of a gale and give rise to a new king!

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.300
Synchro Summon.

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:54.090
Be born, Level 7 D/D/D Gust King Alexander!

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:58.240
Incredible... He even Synchro Summoned.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.910
The effect of D/D/D Flame King Genghis...

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:05.780
When a D/D Monster other than 
itself is Special Summoned,

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:10.220
I can Special Summon a D/D 
Monster from my graveyard.

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:13.750
Be reborn, D/D Swirl Slime!

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:18.170
And Gust King Alexander's effect activates.

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:21.050
When a D/D Monster is Special Summoned,

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:24.380
I can Special Summon one D/D 
Monster from my graveyard,

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:26.590
Level 4 or below!

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:30.500
Come again, D/D Berfomet!

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:34.800
D/D Berfomet's monster effect

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.780
doubles the level of D/D Swirl Slime!

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:45.840
Now he has two Level 4 monsters.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:49.430
Are you saying he has not just 
Fusion and Synchro, but...

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:56.330
I overlay Level 4 D/D Swirl Slime and D/D Berfomet!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:05.300
In order to rule all of existence, 
descend at the world's spire.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.010
Xyz Summon.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:12.650
Be born, Rank 4 Wave King Caesar!

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:19.920
Fusion, Synchro, and even Xyz?

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.350
You're at LDS, but you don't even know that?

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:29.100
Reiji Akaba is famous for his ability to freely 
command the three forms of summoning.

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.460
You knew?

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.440
Well, this is my first time personally seeing them.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:34.820
It's not just three!

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:38.310
Reiji Akaba can also use Pendulum.

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:41.050
I knew that, too!

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.950
And likely... what lies beyond.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:44.880
Beyond?

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:55.760
You say you have come here to fight me?

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:59.900
Yes, if I can defeat the last survivor of Xyz,

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:03.870
I can show the Professor—Leo Akaba,

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:06.140
who forbade me from fighting, what I can do.

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:08.440
That's why I came to this dimension.

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:09.780
But...

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:19.070
I thought that Academia's fight 
to control all the dimensions

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.660
was a righteous one.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:24.940
I was proud of the deeds I had 
accomplished in that fight.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:28.060
But Yuzu said

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:31.850
that what we'd done in the 
Xyz Dimension was unjust.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:36.900
That it was like a hunting game. They enjoyed it.

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:40.390
That they laughed while attacking people.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:45.440
Is that true? What Yuzu said?

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:47.110
It is true.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:51.180
They attacked defenseless civilians.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.200
Hunted them down, as if it were a game.

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:56.970
Battle!

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:59.620
D/D/D Gust King Alexander

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:03.360
attacks Stargazer Magician in defense position!

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:16.280
D/D/D Wave King Caesar

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:19.530
attacks Splashmammoth in 
defense position, as well!

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:33.420
Then, D/D/D Flame King Genghis 
attacks you directly!

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:59.360
Those faces... That laughter...

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:02.300
They're still deeply carved in my eyes and ears.

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:05.080
I could never forget them.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.890
That's our Reiji.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:10.430
Now his opponent has no monsters on the field.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.660
And he halved his opponent's life in one hit.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.680
I set a card and end my turn.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:22.370
I'm sure that so far, things have 
been as you'd expected.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:28.200
I'm sure you think the real fight is only starting.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:33.200
You have already found what lies beyond Pendulum.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:36.200
Now, use it on me.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.790
The new power you have acquired...

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:41.590
You've seen through everything?

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:46.320
I guess that's why they call you the 
genius duelist Reiji Akaba.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:50.930
That's the same brilliant mind with which you 
predicted the battle royal's outcome?

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:54.720
How many would die, how many would survive?

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.440
Satisfied that things went as you predicted?

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:02.230
We are not your puppets!

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.330
Michio and Teppei...

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:08.740
Everyone who was turned into cards...

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.550
They were all people with minds of their own!

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.240
Yuzu, too!

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:18.940
Darling...

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:23.300
Yuzu always stayed with me.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.610
She cheered me on.

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:30.720
Even when I was teased and 
insulted because of my father,

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.440
she stayed with me.

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.760
Because of Yuzu, I...

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:39.430
The reason I found what lies beyond Pendulum

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.820
was because Yuzu worked so hard to get stronger.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.760
That's why I also...

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.790
My turn!

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:54.330
Using the scale set with Trump Witch 
and Xiangsheng Magician,

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.030
I Pendulum Summon!

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:02.070
Return from my Extra Deck!

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.540
Stargazer Magician,

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:08.010
Performapal Splashmammoth,

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:12.260
and from my hand, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:17.300
I activate Splashmammoth's effect!

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:22.190
When using this card as a fusion component, I can 
Fusion Summon without Polymerization.

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:24.820
But Splashmammoth is banished.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:28.920
With Splashmammoth, I fuse

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:31.370
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.120
Dragon with different-colored eyes,

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:38.490
bathe in the splash of the beast 
and produce a new power!

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:41.050
Fusion Summon!

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:45.560
Come out, the ferocious dragon 
with glowing beastly eyes,

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:48.900
Beast-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:55.990
That's the Fusion Dragon he brought 
out for the first time against me!

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:58.960
I activate Stargazer Magician's Monster Effect!

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:03.630
When a Pendulum Monster leaves the 
field, I can Special Summon it.

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:08.110
Return, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:13.180
Then, I activate Performapal Trump 
Witch's Pendulum Effect!

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:17.900
Once per turn, I can perform a Fusion Summon 
with one monster on my side of the field!

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:25.510
I fuse Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
and Stargazer Magician.

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.280
The one who controls mysterious power,

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:33.540
transform into dazzling light and 
reside in the dragon's eye!

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:35.900
Fusion Summon!

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:40.390
Come out, the sky dragon that wields secret arts,

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:44.360
Rune-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:52.350
That's the Fusion Dragon he brought 
out during his duel with me.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:55.390
Beast-Eyes and Rune-Eyes are both monsters

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:58.420
I was able to summon, thanks to Yuzu's help.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:03.290
She wanted to beat LDS, so she asked Sora...

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:06.260
Training? Here with Yuzu?

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:09.180
Yeah. Yuzu said that next time—

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:15.110
Is it a secret to Yuya that you're learning 
Fusion Summoning from me?

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.130
Yuzu is learning Fusion?

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:23.450
Oh? Sora Shiunin taught you?

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.290
I didn't know.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:29.450
I wouldn't have expected you to learn to Fusion 
Summon from an Academia duelist.

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:32.760
You mean you knew that Sora was from Academia?

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:34.430
Yes...

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:39.670
His summon energy far outstripped 
that of the LDS students.

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:41.850
I see...

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:44.260
So his influence

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:49.410
may have also led you to summon forth new dragons.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:52.260
Sora's power went from Yuzu to me?

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.320
You're saying my ability to summon 
Beast-Eyes and Rune-Eyes

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:58.110
also comes from Academia's power?

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:02.490
It's merely a theory. It has not yet been proven.

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:09.050
I was so moved by Yuzu's desire to 
become stronger and beat LDS...

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:13.400
That's why I want to beat you, no matter what!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:17.710
Rune-Eyes Pendulum Dragon, which uses Stargazer 
Magician as a fusion component,

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.690
can attack three times!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.940
Go! Battle, Rune-Eyes!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:28.950
Attack Flame King Genghis, Gust King 
Alexander, and Wave King Caesar!

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.720
Continuous Shiny Burst!

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:50.130
Then, what they said about your 
little sister being taken...

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.660
It's true.

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:55.710
But why do you look so much like Ruri?

00:19:57.260 --> 00:20:00.410
Finish it! Go, Beast-Eyes!

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:02.950
Hell Dive Burst!

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:05.630
Reiji has 1900 life points!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:10.960
If he takes that direct attack from Beast-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon, with its 3000 attack points,

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:11.990
it's over!

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:28.570
What?

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:35.050
I activated the trap card I set, D/D/D Contract Change.

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:39.610
This card banishes the D/D/D Monster

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:43.000
with the highest attack points in my graveyard,

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.740
to negate the damage dealt to me.

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:50.330
Oh, no...

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:51.430
Yuya!

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:52.900
Damn.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:58.440
And I can add one D/D Pendulum 
Monster, Level 4 or below,

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:00.600
from my deck to my hand.

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:05.050
It's clear that your feelings for Yuzu Hiiragi have

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:09.580
tremendously affected your process, 
from discovering Pendulum to Fusion...

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:13.450
But evolution, due to strength 
of your feelings alone,

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:14.590
is not enough to win a duel!

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:19.210
The Lancers are a battle squad 
meant to fight Academia.

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:24.300
You must learn that weakness in a real 
battle could cost you your life!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:26.530
I have no intention of joining the Lancers!

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:30.000
You do not want to save Yuzu Hiiragi?

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:32.440
What?

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:33.910
You're saying

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:36.260
Yuzu is alive?

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:40.340
She was taken by the Obelisk Force?

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:42.810
You're saying you saw that?

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:47.340
Is it possible that she saw Joeri taking her?

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.960
Then, she also knows who I really am.

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:53.110
Now, go on and end your turn.

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:56.530
And then I shall get serious, too.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:22:02.680
If you want to defeat Academia 
and save Yuzu Hiiragi,

00:22:03.240 --> 00:22:05.740
you must first surpass me!

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:48.170
You're saying Yuzu is alive?

00:23:48.170 --> 00:23:50.140
Answer me, Reiji Akaba!

00:23:50.140 --> 00:23:53.240
If you want to defeat Academia and save Yuzu Hiiragi,

00:23:53.720 --> 00:23:55.950
you must first surpass me!

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:57.580
Pendulum Summon!

00:23:57.580 --> 00:24:02.020
Show yourself, ultimate deity who casts 
judgment on the twilight of the gods,

00:24:02.380 --> 00:24:05.290
D/D/D Oblivion King Abyss Ragnarok!

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:08.620
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:11.800
Raise the Flag of Rebellion. 
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon.

00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:14.330
The fun is only getting started!
